diff --git a/docs/export.md b/docs/export.md
index 8422a4f..de4252b 100644
--- a/docs/export.md
+++ b/docs/export.md
@@ -2,8 +2,8 @@
 
 The export writes one CSV file per ledger.
 
-It reads every row of the ledger into memory first, then writes the file.
-A ledger of a few million rows needs gigabytes of memory to export.
-Large exports fail on the small worker with an out-of-memory error.
+It streams rows from the database cursor and writes them as they arrive,
+500 at a time, so memory stays flat however large the ledger is.
+A write that fails closes the cursor and removes the partial file.
 
 Run it with `ledger export --month 2026-03`.
